text i01 "<section class='hero'><p class='eyebrow'>Research</p><h1>Ask the research.</h1><p class='sub'>"
text i02 " works and "
text i03 " versions by "
text i04 ", each with its full text. Ask a question: an agent on my Spark answers from the papers and names the ones it used.</p>\n"
