text itry "<p class='try'>Try <a href='/research/ask?q=What+is+a+Turing+and+how+is+it+measured%3F'>What is a Turing and how is it measured?</a><a href='/research/ask?q=How+does+the+Spark+run+a+model+with+no+CUDA+libraries%3F'>How does the Spark run a model with no CUDA libraries?</a><a href='/research/ask?q=What+separates+a+hive+from+a+swarm+of+agents%3F'>What separates a hive from a swarm of agents?</a></p></section>\n"
